<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NarrationUsage> logic:subClassOf [ a logic:Restriction ; logic:onProperty <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/narrationMode> ; logic:allValuesFrom logic:Thing ] .
